# Flutter architecture

Keep the existing layers: `config` / `models` → `services` → `notifiers` → `screens` / `widgets`. Put access policy in `lib/domain/`.

- Table and RPC names go through `GmTables`. Do not hardcode `'gm_...'`.
- Theme through `Theme.of(context)` and POS chrome (`AppTheme`, `DarkBackground`, `StoreBrandingHeader`).
- Qty display: `qty_format`. Do not invent a second formatter.
- Prefer packages already in `pubspec.yaml`. Add a dependency only when the task requires it.

```dart
// ❌ BAD
await client.from('gm_items').select();

// ✅ GOOD
await client.from(GmTables.items).select();
```
